From: lfdevs <lfdevs@lfdevs.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 04:26:40 +0800
Subject: backend: defer camera nodes until PipeWire is ready

Keep camera resource fds attached while PipeWire reconnects, but only create virtual video streams after a live PipeWire core is available. This allows camera forwarding to recover when the sound service starts late.
---
 backend/anland/anland_camera.c | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/backend/anland/anland_camera.c b/backend/anland/anland_camera.c
index e1b65c0..d46f864 100644
--- a/backend/anland/anland_camera.c
+++ b/backend/anland/anland_camera.c
@@ -821,7 +821,9 @@ void anland_camera_set_resources(int ctrl_fd, const int *stream_fds, int num_cam
             cam->fmt_w = qw[i];
             cam->fmt_h = qh[i];
         }
-        create_node(cam);
+        if (c->pw_connected && c->core) {
+            create_node(cam);
+        }
         attach_fd(cam, stream_fds[i]);
     }
 
